contact=head('Free quotation','Your space has potential.<br>Let’s talk about it.','Tell Leon what you’d like to change. Call directly or use the planner below to prepare your free, no-obligation quote enquiry.')+f'''<section class="section wrap" style="padding-top:10px"><div class="content-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Prepare your quote enquiry</span><h2 style="font-size:42px">A few details to get started.</h2><p>This planner prepares a message for your email app. You’ll review it and press send there. Nothing is submitted by this website.</p><form class="quote-form" id="quote-form"><div class="form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Property postcode<input name="postcode" autocomplete="postal-code" maxlength="12" required placeholder="e.g. NN1 1AA"></label></div><label>What are you planning?<select name="service" required><option value="">Select a service</option><option>Block paving / driveway</option><option>Resin driveway</option><option>Patio / porcelain paving</option><option>Landscaping / lawn / artificial grass</option><option>Shed base / groundworks</option><option>A combination / not sure yet</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="160" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Phone number (optional)<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="30" placeholder="Your contact number"></label></div><label>Tell us about your space<textarea name="details" maxlength="1500" required placeholder="What would you like to change? Approximate size, access, preferred finish and timing are all helpful."></textarea></label><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Review my enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="small">Your details stay in this page until you choose to open your email app or copy your message. Read our <a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">privacy information</a>.</p></form><section class="quote-result panel" id="quote-result" hidden tabindex="-1"><h3>Your enquiry is ready to review.</h3><label>Your message<textarea id="quote-message" readonly></textarea></label><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" id="email-enquiry" href="mailto:NNPaving@gmail.com">Open email app ↗</a><button type="button" class="btn outline" id="copy-enquiry">Copy message</button></div><p class="small" id="quote-status" aria-live="polite">Not sent yet. Open your email app, add any photographs and send to NNPaving@gmail.com.</p><p class="small">No email app? Copy the message into your usual email service, or call Leon.</p></section><noscript><p>Call 07999 749569 or email NNPaving@gmail.com with your name, postcode and project details.</p></noscript></div><aside><div class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">Straight to the person behind the work</span><h3>Speak to Leon Read.</h3><p>Northampton<br>Paving & groundwork services</p><a class="text-link" href="tel:+447999749569">07999 749569</a><p style="margin-top:20px"><a href="mailto:NNPaving@gmail.com">NNPaving@gmail.com</a></p><a class="text-link" href="{FB}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NN Paving on Facebook ↗</a></div><div style="padding:30px 0"><h3>What helps us understand your project?</h3><p>Photographs of the whole space, approximate measurements, your postcode and the finish you have in mind. You don’t need to have every detail decided.</p><p class="small">Project costs, availability, payment terms and any guarantees are confirmed directly with Leon.</p></div></aside></div></section>'''
routes.append(shell('/contact/','Free Paving & Landscaping Quote | NN Paving Northampton','Call Leon at NN Paving on 07999 749569 or prepare an email enquiry for your Northampton driveway, patio or landscaping project.',contact))
routes.append(shell('/privacy/','Privacy & Website Information | NN Paving Northampton','How this NN Paving website handles quotation enquiries and links to other services.',head('Website information','Your enquiry.<br>Your choice.','A straightforward explanation of how the website’s quote planner works.')+'<section class="section wrap content" style="padding-top:0;max-width:900px"><h2>Quote planner</h2><p>The planner creates a message in your browser. It does not submit your details to a website database and does not save them in browser storage. When you choose “Open email app”, the message is passed to your email software. You decide whether to send it to NN Paving. “Copy message” places the prepared text on your device clipboard.</p><h3>Contact details</h3><p>For questions about an enquiry or your information, contact NN Paving at <a href="mailto:NNPaving@gmail.com">NNPaving@gmail.com</a> or 07999 749569. Do not include sensitive personal information in an initial project enquiry.</p><h3>External services</h3><p>Facebook links open Facebook, which operates under its own privacy policies. Fonts may be loaded from Google Fonts, which receives the network information needed to deliver them. No advertising or analytics scripts are included in the site code. The page may keep temporary interaction markers in memory for this visit, such as a quote or phone link being opened; they are cleared on reload and are not sent to NN Paving or any analytics service. The hosting service may process technical logs and, for private access, sign-in information.</p><h3>Business information</h3><p>Contact information, the service range and photographs were sourced from NN Paving’s Facebook page. Its recommendation summary was checked on 30 September 2026. No awards, accreditations, company registration number, insurance details, fixed guarantees or finance offers have been added without verification.</p></section>'))
