quote_steps='''<ol class="quote-steps" aria-label="Quote enquiry steps"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Tell us about the space</strong><small>Postcode, project type and a few useful details.</small></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Review your message</strong><small>The page prepares an email for you to check.</small></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Add photographs and send</strong><small>Your email app remains in control of the final send.</small></div></li></ol>'''
